@M_KOJO_EN01_SUCCESS_COM_K119_300
;成否判定
;TFLAG:192(-2=コマンド終了、-1＝強制失敗、0=COM依存、1=強制成功or大成功
TFLAG:192 =0

@M_KOJO_EN01_MESSAGE_COM_K119_300
;コマンド共通メッセージ(TRAIN_MESSAGE) 
;削除すると「～話をした。」とかが消えます。また、削除した場合は自動で口上色が付きません。
;口上メイン呼出
CALL M_KOJO_EN01_MESSAGE_COM_K119_300_1
RETURN RESULT

@M_KOJO_EN01_MESSAGE_COM_K119_300_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL
	IF TFLAG:193 == -3 ;custom code, hate mark 3
		IF IS_CHILD(MASTER)
			SELECTCASE RAND:3
				CASE 0
					PRINTFORMW 「Mama's really mad at ya. Go away and gimme a chance to cool down.」
				CASE 1
					PRINTFORMW 「Are ya here to apologize?」
					PRINTFORMW 「No? Then get outta here 'fore I tan yer hide.」
				CASE 2
					PRINTFORMW 「Get outta here. I'm still thinkin' up a punishment for ya.」
			ENDSELECT
		ELSEIF IS_FALLEN(TARGET)
			SELECTCASE RAND:3
				CASE 0
					PRINTFORMW 「I'm still pissed off at ya. Go away and gimme a chance to cool down.」
				CASE 1
					PRINTFORMW 「I'm not in the mood to talk with ya.」
				CASE 2
					PRINTFORMW 「I ain't talkin' to ya until ya apologize for what ya did.」
			ENDSELECT
		ELSE
			SELECTCASE RAND:3
				CASE 0
					PRINTFORMW 「Get outta my face 'fore I start hackin' bits offa ya.」
				CASE 1
					PRINTFORML 「I ain't got nothin' to say t'the likes a' you.」
					PRINTFORMDW Nemuno folds %HIS_HER(TARGET)% arms and turns %HIS_HER(TARGET)% back to you.
				CASE 2
					PRINTFORML 「D'ya really think y'can just waltz up to me and start chattin' after what ya did?」
					PRINTFORMW 「Piss off.」
			ENDSELECT
		ENDIF
		RETURN
	ENDIF

	IF RAND:3
		CALL K119_CONVERSATION_INTERACTION
		SIF RESULT
			RETURN 0
	ENDIF

	IF IS_CHILD(MASTER)
		$NEMUNO_CHILD_CONVOS
		SELECTCASE RAND:12
			CASE 0
				PRINTFORMW 「You are goin' to the temple school, right?」
				PRINTFORMW 「I ain't gonna let one of my kids grow up without gettin' a good education!」
			CASE 1
				PRINTFORMW 「As long as yer livin' under my roof, y'gotta do yer fair share of the chores.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Don't worry, I ain't gonna ask ya to chop wood or go huntin' with me or nothin'. I know yer only a kid.」
				PRINTFORMW 「But you gotta keep yer room clean!」
			CASE 2
				PRINTFORMW 「Y'don't have to worry 'bout youkai as long as y'follow a few simple rules.」
				PRINTFORML 「Don't be outside the village or my house after the sun goes down.」
				PRINTFORML 「If y'do run into a youkai, be polite n' respectful. This goes double if it's outside the village.」
				PRINTFORML 「Always carry a piece a' steak with you. Most youkai'll only attack 'cause they're hungry.」
				PRINTFORMW 「And if nothin' else works... just mention that yer my kid.」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno smiles grimly.
				PRINTFORMW 「No youkai's dumb enough to mess with a human under my protection.」
			CASE 3
				PRINTFORMW 「Oh? You wanna hear a story?」
				PRINTFORMW 「Let's see...」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno thinks for a moment.
				SELECTCASE RAND:7
					CASE 0
						PRINTFORMW 「Y'know about the Inchlings, right?」
						PRINTFORMW 「Tiny lil' fellas. About... oh, this high?」
						PRINTFORMDW Nemuno crouches down and holds her hand a little ways about the ground.
						PRINTFORMW 「Well, they're all descended from a fella named Issun-boushi.」
						PRINTFORMW 「A long, long time ago, there was this old couple who didn't have any kids...」
					CASE 1
						PRINTFORMW 「Years ago, there was this whole thing where the seasons were outta whack.」
						PRINTFORMW 「You probably don't know about it. I'm sure y'were too young to remember, if y'were even born back then.」
						PRINTFORMW 「But I remember it like it was yesterday.」
						PRINTFORMW 「I was out on a hunt, mindin' my own business, when I saw somethin' flyin' overhead...」
					CASE 2
						PRINTFORMW 「Now this story, I heard from a lady I knew... oh, years and years ago. Centuries, maybe.」
						PRINTFORMW 「It's a story about a shrine maiden. Not the Hakurei girl or the Kochiya girl, or even one'a their ancestors.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Although they say she kinda looked like the Hakurei girl...」
						PRINTFORMW 「Anyway, this shrine maiden lived in the Outside World.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Years ago, the youkai near the shrine had gone on a rampage, but she grabbed her gohei and knocked some sense back into 'em.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Things had been peaceful since then, but one day, a tanuki came runnin' into her shrine...」
					CASE 3
						PRINTFORMW 「A long, long time ago, when that shrine maiden was just a kid, there was a cave in these mountains.」
						PRINTFORMW 「And that cave led to Makai, the world of demons.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Nobody was really concerned about it, since the demons kept to themselves and didn't come to Gensokyo to cause trouble...」
						PRINTFORMW 「But then one day, they did.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Hordes of 'em, runnin' around, droppin' litter everywhere and crowdin' the souvenir shops.」
						PRINTFORMW 「When the shrine maiden heard about this, she hopped on her flyin' turtle and headed for the mountains...」
					CASE 4
						PRINTFORMW 「There's a sarugami livin' around here who says she's the second comin' of Sun Wukong.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Y'ever heard of him? He's an interestin' fella.」
						PRINTFORMW 「See, more n' a thousand years ago, in the Outside World, there was this mountain.」
						PRINTFORMW 「And on that mountain, there was an egg made a' stone...」
					CASE 5
						PRINTFORMW 「This one's a story I heard from another yamanba a long, long time ago.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Hundreds n' hundreds a' years ago, there was this dancer.」
						PRINTFORMW 「People called her "Hyakuma Yamanba" 'cause she was always performin' dances about us yamanba.」
						PRINTFORMW 「One day, she was goin' on a pilgrimage...」
					CASE 6
						PRINTFORMW 「Y'know the oni used to live on Youkai Mountain, right?」
						PRINTFORMW 「Before they all moved to Old Hell.」
						PRINTFORMW 「Well, I knew an oni back then, and she told me this story...」
						PRINTFORMDW Nemuno shifts into a more comfortable position.
						PRINTFORMW 「There were two oni on this mountain once. Twins.」
						PRINTFORMW 「A red one named Akane, and a blue one named Aoi.」
						PRINTFORMW 「And Akane, she wanted to make friends with humans...」
				ENDSELECT
			CASE 4
				PRINTFORML 「Y'really shouldn't be hanging around yer ol' mom all the time.」
				PRINTFORMW 「A kid like you should be goin' out n' playin' with friends yer own age.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Actually, I don't think I've ever met any a'yer friends.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Why don't ya invite 'em over to play one of these days?」
			CASE 5
				IF TIME:2 == 1
					PRINTFORMW 「Well, well, someone's up early.」
					PRINTFORMDW Nemuno smiles at you and ruffles your hair.
					PRINTFORMW 「Wish I still had yer energy...」
				ELSEIF TIME:2 > 5
					PRINTFORMW 「Oi! The hell are you doin' up this late?!」
					PRINTFORMW 「You're a growing kid! You need yer beauty sleep!」
					PRINTFORMDW Nemuno continues scolding you...
				ELSE
					GOTO NEMUNO_CHILD_CONVOS
				ENDIF
			CASE 6
				PRINTFORMW 「You ain't havin' trouble in school, are ya?」
				PRINTFORMW 「If y'are, it's OK. You can tell me.」
				PRINTFORMW 「I dunno how much I'll be able to help with yer homework...」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno grins.
				PRINTFORMW 「But I can definitely nag ya to study if yer slackin' off.」

			CASE 7
				PRINTFORMW 「You did remember to weed the garden, right?」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno folds her arms.
				PRINTFORMW 「I ain't lettin' you go out to play until you finish all yer chores.」

			CASE 8
				PRINTFORMW 「If y'do good on yer next test...」
				PRINTFORMW 「I'll take y'out to get somethin' to eat at Mystia's food cart.」
				PRINTFORMW 「So you'd better study hard! You don't wanna miss out on one o'them lampreys, do ya?」

			CASE 9
				PRINTFORMW 「Y'remember what I told ya about that kuda-gitsune, right?」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno frowns.
				PRINTFORMW 「No matter what she tells ya, don't buy any cards offa her. It's nothin' but a scam.」

			CASE 10
				PRINTFORMW 「Don't go too far from home today. I've seen a lotta tengu around lately.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Nothin' those feathered freaks like more than kidnappin' kids. Can't even bribe 'em with steak.」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno leans down and looks in your eyes.
				PRINTFORMW 「Remember what I told you, now! If a tengu grabs ya, scream and kick and bite.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Go for the eyes, between their legs, and their wings.」
				PRINTFORMW 「And if it's a white wolf, run for the nearest stream. There's nothin' those mangy curs hate more than a bath.」

			CASE 11
				PRINTFORM 「Y'down for a round of 
				IF TIME:2 == 5
					PRINTFORMW koi-koi?」
					PRINTFORMDW Nemuno pulls a dog-eared deck of hanafuda cards out of her pocket.
				ELSEIF TIME:2 > 5
					PRINTFORMW koi-koi tomorrow?」
				ELSE
					PRINTFORMW koi-koi after dinner?」
				ENDIF
		ENDSELECT
	ELSE

		IF CHK_DATENOW(CFLAG:TARGET:デート中)

			SELECTCASE RAND:3
				CASE 0
					SELECTCASE CFLAG:MASTER:現在位置 / 100

						CASE 0 ;Hakurei Shrine

						CASE 1 ;Myouren Temple
							SELECTCASE RAND:3
								CASE 0
									PRINTFORML 

								CASE 1
									PRINTFORML 
								CASE 2
									PRINTFORML 
							ENDSELECT

						CASE 2 ;Human Village
							SELECTCASE RAND:2
								CASE 0
									PRINTFORMW 「Y'know, the temple school's an all-ages school.」
									PRINTFORMW 「I've seen my fair share o' Outsiders in there practicin' their Japanese.」
									PRINTFORMW 「Hell, I've taught a few Home Ec classes there. Apparently nobody in the Outside World knows how to sew.」
									PRINTFORMDW Nemuno shakes her head.
									PRINTFORMW 「Y'should ask Keine-san what classes she's offerin' this month. Yer never too old to learn.」

								CASE 1
									PRINTFORMW 「Misumaru invited me to a meeting of that "Girls Club" she goes to a while back.」
									PRINTFORMW 「I ain't much of a social butterfly, but I figured I'd go just t'be polite.」
									PRINTFORMDW Nemuno grimaces.
									PRINTFORMW 「It was one a' the most awkward experiences of my life. Half a dozen old biddies drinkin' themselves into a stupor, gossipin' about all the other old biddies that didn't get invited...」
									PRINTFORMW 「Blamin' everyone n' everything other'n themselves for them not bein' able to get hitched, n' fantasizin' about all the perverted things they'd like to do to whatever poor \@ IS_MALE(MASTER) ? fella # girl\@ caught their eye.」

								CASE 2
									; PRINTFORMW 「Keine-san told me there's a youkai bar in the village now.」

							ENDSELECT

						CASE 3 ;Scarlet Devil Mansion
							SELECTCASE RAND:3
								CASE 0
									PRINTFORMW 「That Flandre %PRINT_MALE("boy", 50)%'s gotta get lonely bein' cooped up in that basement all the time, no?」
									PRINTFORMW 「Maybe we should see if she n' her sister'd be down fer a nice game a' koi-koi one o' these days.」

								CASE 1
									PRINTFORMW 「I hear tell that the Scarlet Casino plans to start holdin' bingo nights once a month.」
									PRINTFORMDW Nemuno looks over at you. There's a gleam in her eye.
									PRINTFORMW 「I'm sure a nice young %PRINT_MALE("man_:lady", MASTER)% like you wouldn't mind spottin' \@ TALENT:119:恋人 ? yer %PRINT_MALE("boy", TARGET)%friend # a poor 'ol %PRINT_MALE("man_:lady", TARGET)% like me\@ a few Charisma...」

								CASE 2
									PRINTFORMW 「It's best t'mind yer P's n' Q's when yer in a vampire's territory.」
									PRINTFORMDW Nemuno looks a little nervous.
									PRINTFORMW 「Do I gotta stick my pinky out when drinkin' tea? Curtsy in front a' every portrait? Etiquette ain't exactly my strong suit...」
							ENDSELECT

						CASE 4 ;Bamboo Forest of the Lost
							SELECTCASE RAND:3
								CASE 0
									PRINTFORML 「Careful!」
									PRINTFORMDW Nemuno grabs your arm.
									PRINTFORMDW You look around... and see a divot in the ground that you were about to step on.
									PRINTFORMW 「Pitfall trap. That rabbit's always diggin' 'em.」

								CASE 1
									PRINTFORMW 「If yer worried about us gettin' lost, don't be. I'll just create a sanctuary.」

								CASE 2
									PRINTFORML 「Eientei's around here somewhere, yeah? They say the medicines they make there can do damn near anything.」
									PRINTFORMW 「Wonder if they've got anythin' for wrinkles...」
							ENDSELECT

						CASE 5 ;Forest of Magic
							SELECTCASE RAND:3
								CASE 0
									PRINTFORMW 「Gah... all these spores're makin' my allergies act up somethin' fierce.」
									PRINTFORMDW Nemuno pulls a tattered handkerchief out of her pocket and blows her nose explosively.

								CASE 1
									PRINTFORML 

								CASE 2
									PRINTFORML 
							ENDSELECT

						CASE 6 ;Sanzu River

						CASE 7 ;Youkai Mountain (Foot)

						CASE 8 ;Youkai Mountain (Summit)
							SELECTCASE RAND:3
								CASE 0
									PRINTFORMW 「Apparently the whole mountain's honeycombed with tunnels thanks to that daitengu and her oomukade.」
									PRINTFORMDW Nemuno shakes her head.
									PRINTFORMW 「I just hope they know what they're doin'. I'm gonna be pissed if I come home and find my house at the bottom of a sinkhole.」

								CASE 1
									PRINTFORMW 「You sure we should be up here?」
									PRINTFORMDW Nemuno looks a little nervous.
									PRINTFORMW 「The tengu n' I've got a non-aggression treaty, y'see. And I don't wanna break it by comin' in their territory without permission.」
									PRINTFORMW 「Gimme a holler if y'see one comin', a'right? I'll make a sanctuary fer us t'hide in until they're gone.」

								CASE 2
									PRINTFORMW 「Everyone's always prayin' at that damn shrine, and I don't see the point.」
									PRINTFORMW 「There're dozens a'other gods on this mountain. The yamanba and the human hunters on this mountain've been prayin' to 'em for as long as I can remember.」
									PRINTFORMW 「What's so special about these new ones?」
							ENDSELECT

						CASE 9 ;Underworld
							SELECTCASE RAND:3
								CASE 0
									PRINTFORML 「We'd best be careful down here.」
									PRINTFORMW 「This is where all the youkai who got kicked offa the surface live. Who knows what might set 'em off?」
								CASE 1
									; PRINTFORMW 「They say a satori's the mistress a' the Palace a' the Earth Spirits.」
									; PRINTFORMW 「」
								CASE 2
									PRINTFORML 
							ENDSELECT

						CASE 10 ;Dream World / Moon

						CASE 11 ;Makai
					ENDSELECT

				CASE 1
					GOTO REGULAR_CONVOS

				CASE 2
					SELECTCASE RAND:3
						CASE 0
							PRINTFORMW 「I don't usually leave my territory, 'cept if I'm takin' a kid I adopted to the temple school or visitin' one a' them once they grow up...」
							PRINTFORMW 「So most a' this is new to me.」
						CASE 1
							PRINTFORMW （Dammit... everyone's gawkin' at me, ain't they?）
							PRINTFORMW （Knew I should'a worn some makeup...）
						CASE 2
							PRINTFORMW 「Heh... we should do this more often. Can't remember the last time I had this much fun...」
							PRINTFORMDW Nemuno grins at you and takes your hand.
							PRINTFORMW 「So, where to?」
					ENDSELECT
			ENDSELECT
			RETURN 1
		ENDIF

		$REGULAR_CONVOS
		SELECTCASE IFRAND("0TO5", 1, "6TO7", ABL:TARGET:親密 < 2, "8TO12", ABL:TARGET:親密 >= 2, "13TO18", TALENT:[[ネムノ]]:恋人)
			CASE 0
				PRINTFORML 「Y'like goin' fer walks, %CALLNAME:MASTER%?」
				PRINTFORMW 「Ain't nothin' better than goin fer a stroll in the forest, listenin' t'the birds.」

			CASE 1
				PRINTFORML 「...」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno stares at you awkwardly as the conversation dies down.
				PRINTFORMDW Looks like you'll have to find a new topic...

			CASE 2
				PRINTFORML 「If yer walkin' around on Youkai Mountain, keep an eye out fer carvings on the trees.」
				PRINTFORMW 「That's one of the ways we yamanba mark our territories.」

			CASE 3
				PRINTFORMW 「Hmm, is that so? Things've really changed...」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno nods as %HE_SHE(TARGET)% listens to your story.
			CASE 4
				PRINTFORML 「They say there was an incident a couple years back. Seasons were all outta whack or somethin'.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Didn't notice anything like that myself, but maybe I just got lucky and it stayed Fall in the mountains.」
			CASE 5
				PRINTFORMW 「...」
				PRINTFORMW 「Nice weather, ain't it?」
				PRINTFORMDW ...Maybe you should pick the conversation topics.
			CASE 6
				PRINTFORML 「You wanna know more about me?」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno scowls.
				PRINTFORMW 「What's there to say? I'm a yamanba. I keep to myself. That's about it.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Why don't ya tell me about yerself instead?」
			CASE 7
				PRINTFORML 「I've heard about you.」
				PRINTFORMW 「They say you've been everywhere in Gensokyo, from the Hakurei Shrine to the Youkai Mountain to Old Hell to the Moon.」
				PRINTFORMW 「You must be pretty damn strong to get into so many different places...」
			CASE 8
				PRINTFORMW 「I wonder what happened to that ice fairy? The one who said she was "overlord of Gensokyo".」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno snorts.
				PRINTFORMW 「Probably picked a fight with the wrong person and got blown to smithereens.」
			CASE 9
				PRINTFORMW 「Say what you will about tengu, but when you make a deal with them they stick to it.」
				PRINTFORML 「Ever since we made that non-aggression pact, I've only seen... three tengu in my territory?」
				PRINTFORMW 「One got lost, one didn't know where my territory was, and one was investigating some incident.」
				PRINTFORMW 「'Course, I still see 'em flyin' through my airspace... but I ain't petty enough to kick up a fuss about it.」
			CASE 10
				PRINTFORMW 「Y'know that monkey girl, Biten? They say she was raised by a yamanba.」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno shakes her head.
				PRINTFORML 「Then how'd she end up workin' as a thug for the Kiketsu Family?」
				PRINTFORMW 「All my kids know I'd tan their hides if they even thought'a doin' somethin' like that!」
				PRINTFORMW 「Some people just ain't fit to be parents.」
			CASE 11
				PRINTFORML 「Haven't seen much game around lately.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Hope it ain't a sign of another incident breakin' out...」
			CASE 12
				PRINTFORMW 「Woke up this mornin' and found out my roof was leakin'.」
				PRINTFORMW 「So I need to get that fixed, on top of gettin' some new pots, fixin' the water pump, repairin' my favorite dress...」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno sighs.
				PRINTFORMW 「I swear, it's just one damn thing after another.」
			CASE 13
				PRINTFORMW 「Y'know, when you n' I first met, I never thought I'd fall for ya, let alone become yer %PRINT_MALE("boy", TARGET)%friend.」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno blushes.
				PRINTFORMW 「Love really is blind, ain't it?」
			CASE 14
				PRINTFORML 「I'm gonna need t'get some furniture fer times when y'stay the night.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Just a futon and a wood stove ain't gonna cut it anymore...」
			CASE 15
				PRINTFORML 「Y'know... sometimes I have dreams about bein' a little girl.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Sometimes I'm sweepin' the floor, other times I'm choppin' vegetables.」
				PRINTFORMW 「They feel like memories, but... I can't remember ever bein' anything but an old woman.」
				PRINTFORMDL Nemuno frowns.
				PRINTFORMW 「It kinda creeps me out, t'be honest...」
			CASE 16
				IF TALENT:[[ネムノ]]:妊娠 || EXP:[[ネムノ]]:出産経験 > 0
					PRINTFORML 「Y'know, bein' a single mama ain't a good look.」
				ELSE
					PRINTFORML 「I've always wondered what it'd be like to raise a kid of my own.」
					PRINTFORML 「My own flesh n' blood, like.」
					PRINTFORML 「And bein' a single mama ain't a good look.」
				ENDIF
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno is looking at you expectantly...
			CASE 17
				PRINTFORML 「People ain't gossipin' about you n' me, are they?」
				PRINTFORML 「I know it ain't normal... an old hag and a young'un like you.」
			CASE 18
				PRINTFORML 「Y'know, I drew a fortune at Hakurei Shrine one time. An' y'know what it said?」
				PRINTFORML 「"Love: Won't happen."」
				PRINTFORMDW Nemuno snorts.
				PRINTFORMW 「Guess that means it was wrong about me never catchin' a cold too...」
		ENDSELECT
	ENDIF
ENDIF
RETURN 1
