			PRINTFORMW 「Awright, these next few y'should be able t'jus' dodge by movin' yer body.」
			PRINTFORMW 「It'll be good practice fer grazin' in a real fight.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Y'ready?」
		CASE 6
			PRINTFORMDL 『Hiyaaaaa!!』
			PRINTFORMDW You kick the crudely made training dummy in the crotch as hard as you can.
			PRINTFORMW 「Good job!」
			PRINTFORMDW Nemuno ruffles your hair.
			PRINTFORMW 「Damn good kiai, too. I felt that one in my bones!」
			PRINTFORMW 「Awright, now do 20 throat palm strikes!」
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF
